# Max Pool meta server list - STATIC entries.
#
# Game servers that point meta_server1 at this host register themselves and do
# not belong here. Use this file for servers that cannot register: other
# people's masters, or a room whose operator you cannot ask to reconfigure.
#
# One game server per line:  <host-or-ip> <port>
# Port must match "port" in ultra_server.scs (default 35000).
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Re-read on every request - edit freely, no restart needed.
#
# The address here is handed straight to clients, so it must be an address
# they can actually reach. Behind NAT, use the public address, not the LAN one.

CHANGEME.example.invalid 35000
